            "review_text": "Resort39387508969\n1 contribution\n0\nVegan noodle\nJul 2026 • Family\nJust tried Chan Chan Noodle and wow, it totally lived up to the hype! The broth was super flavorful and rich, and the noodles had the perfect chewy texture. Generous portions with really fresh toppings, too. It gets pretty packed during peak hours, but the service was quick and the food came out piping hot. Easily a 9/10—definitely coming back!\"\nRead more\nWritten July 7, 2026\nGrandTour66791830444\nThank you for coming and for the lovely compliment! 🧡 This motivates us to do even better. Hope to see you again! 🥰\nWritten July 27, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
